{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:48 2026-10-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:48 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:48 2026-10-07 HKT</p><p>今(7日)早上8時27分，一部載有學童校巴駛至大埔安埔路12號富善邨對開，疑駛入大埔浸信會公立學校期間，懷疑失控自炒撞向入閘的石躉，車上至少8名學童受傷。救援人員趕至現場，為傷者治理，現場所見，校巴右車身近車頭位置撞毀，石躉被撞毀，警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"校巴右車身損毀。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b772bc191749c1b86edf1ebe5d0b28af/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_28_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e8a2dce065c6c3428c91ad31d5b15dc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_28_39.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbbec4086f85bdd237d10af495949d05/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_28_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72bdfd80859706e69922e1f46597cd41/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_28_41.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c91b84411be26064c84c0fb608c630a5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_28_34.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d7efed259957a4100733ff617271dd6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_36_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大埔浸信會公立學校有學童因車禍受傷。劉漢權攝  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ef8672a5a232e93987cb0fccdba5e40/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_36_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"石躉被撞毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0702624ce739d64398de2b0ee4895e37/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_36_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"石躉被撞毀。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65191abb06a96b3ce33499559ae22dbf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_09_36_14.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T02:00:32.605670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}